   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 HTTPS + JWT (RS256, iss/aud/exp)   2 WAF rules, then API Gateway throttling\n3 VPC Link to the internal NLB   4 NLB to the API on 8080   5 API: T1/T4/T8 in DynamoDB + publish to SQS (202)\n6 Processor: long poll SQS, T2/T3/T5/T6, payment via PrivateLink   7 Every minute: Lambda T7 expiry + R1/R2 republish\nOWASP 2025: scopes + 404 on foreign orders, TLS + KMS everywhere, pinned digests, rate limits, audit trail",
   "originalText": "1 HTTPS + JWT (RS256, iss/aud/exp)   2 WAF rules, then API Gateway throttling\n3 VPC Link to the internal NLB   4 NLB to the API on 8080   5 API: T1/T4/T8 in DynamoDB + publish to SQS (202)\n6 Processor: long poll SQS, T2/T3/T5/T6, payment via PrivateLink   7 Every minute: Lambda T7 expiry + R1/R2 republish\nOWASP 2025: scopes + 404 on foreign orders, TLS + KMS everywhere, pinned digests, rate limits, audit trail",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
